   "lines": [
    "Elliott, Jack & I took",
    "Mother, Edith & Corinne",
    "out sailing; in the",
    "evening we all,",
    "together with Uncle",
    "Jimmie & Aunt Annie",
    "and Alfred & Emlen,",
    "took tea at Wests.",
    "Afterwards Edith & I",
    "went up to the",
    "summer house.",
    "My ride today was",
    "so long and hard",
    "that I am afraid",
    "it may have injured",
    "my horse."
   ],
